---
import AdminNav from '../../../components/AdminNav.astro';
import '@fontsource/sora/400.css';
import '@fontsource/sora/600.css';
import '../../../styles/crm.css';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en-GB"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"/><title>Enquiries | NC Digital Admin</title></head>
<body>
<AdminNav />
<header class="crm-top"><a class="crm-brand" href="/admin/links/">Enquiries</a><nav aria-label="Admin navigation"><button id="refresh">Refresh</button></nav></header>
<main>
<section class="crm-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR CUSTOMER CONVERSATIONS</p><h1>A good first impression.<br/><span>A better follow-up.</span></h1></div><div class="mailbox"><span class="connection-dot" id="connection-dot"></span><div><strong>nathan@nc-digital.co.uk</strong><p id="connection-status">Checking mailbox…</p></div><button id="sync" disabled>Sync replies ↻</button></div></section>
<div id="notice" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></div>
<details id="setup-panel" class="setup-panel" hidden><summary>Mailbox &amp; form connection</summary><div id="setup-copy"></div><p>Zoho credentials are configured securely on the server. No password or API token needs to be entered into this page.</p><p>Form notifications are queued through Zoho. Incoming ticket replies sync from Zoho; unrelated emails stay in your mailbox. Attachments remain in Zoho.</p></details>
<section class="metrics" aria-label="Enquiry overview"><div><span>New enquiries</span><strong id="count-new">—</strong></div><div><span>In progress</span><strong id="count-open">—</strong></div><div><span>Waiting for customer</span><strong id="count-waiting">—</strong></div><div><span>Follow-ups due</span><strong id="count-overdue">—</strong></div></section>
<section class="inbox" aria-label="Enquiries inbox">
<aside class="ticket-list-panel"><div class="list-heading"><h2>Inbox</h2><span id="list-count">0 enquiries</span></div><form id="filters"><label class="search-label"><span class="sr-only">Search enquiries</span><input id="search" type="search" maxlength="120" placeholder="Search name, email or subject…"/></label><div class="filter-row"><label><span class="sr-only">Ticket status</span><select id="status-filter"><option value="all">All statuses</option><option value="new">New</option><option value="open">In progress</option><option value="waiting">Waiting</option><option value="closed">Closed</option><option value="spam">Spam</option></select></label><label><span class="sr-only">Assigned to</span><select id="assignee-filter"><option value="all">Everyone</option><option value="nathan">Nathan</option><option value="ben">Ben</option></select></label></div><label class="due-filter"><input id="overdue-filter" type="checkbox"/> Follow-ups due only</label><label class="due-filter"><input id="archived-filter" type="checkbox"/> Show archived enquiries</label><button class="sr-only" type="submit">Search</button></form><div id="ticket-list" aria-label="Ticket list"><p class="empty-list">Loading enquiries…</p></div><div class="pagination"><button id="previous-page" aria-label="Previous page" disabled>←</button><span id="page-label">Page 1</span><button id="next-page" aria-label="Next page" disabled>→</button></div></aside>
<div id="ticket-empty" class="ticket-empty"><span class="empty-mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><h2>A conversation starts here.</h2><p>Choose an enquiry to see its history, add a note or send a reply.</p><p>New website enquiries will appear here once form capture is enabled.</p></div>
<section id="ticket-detail" class="ticket-detail" aria-label="Selected enquiry" hidden>
<div class="conversation"><header class="conversation-heading"><button id="back-inbox">← Inbox</button><div><p id="ticket-reference" class="eyebrow"></p><h2 id="ticket-subject"></h2><p id="ticket-from"></p></div><span id="ticket-status" class="badge"></span></header><button type="button" id="latest-message">Jump to latest ↑</button><div id="messages" class="messages" aria-label="Conversation history"></div>
<form id="composer" class="composer"><div class="composer-tabs"><button id="reply-mode" type="button" class="active" aria-pressed="true">Email reply</button><button id="note-mode" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Private note</button></div><p id="composer-recipient"></p><label for="reply-body" class="sr-only">Message</label><textarea id="reply-body" rows="5" maxlength="16000" placeholder="Write a helpful reply…" required></textarea><div class="composer-footer"><p id="draft-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p id="composer-hint">Replies are queued for sending from your Zoho mailbox.</p><button id="send-message" class="primary" type="submit" disabled>Send reply ↗</button></div></form></div>
<aside class="customer-panel"><h3>Customer details</h3><div id="customer-link"></div><dl id="customer-details"></dl><form id="ticket-settings"><label>Email for replies<input id="edit-email" type="email" maxlength="254" autocomplete="email" placeholder="Add an email address for replies"/></label><label>Status<select id="edit-status"><option value="new">New</option><option value="open">In progress</option><option value="waiting">Waiting for customer</option><option value="closed">Closed</option><option value="spam">Spam</option></select></label><label>Assigned to<select id="edit-assignee"><option value="nathan">Nathan</option><option value="ben">Ben</option></select></label><label>Priority<select id="edit-priority"><option value="low">Low</option><option value="normal">Normal</option><option value="high">High</option></select></label><label>Lead source<select id="edit-lead-source"><option value="website">Website</option><option value="website-cost-calculator">Cost calculator</option><option value="whatsapp">WhatsApp</option><option value="phone">Phone</option><option value="referral">Referral</option><option value="manual">Other / manual</option></select></label><label>Lead temperature<select id="edit-lead-temperature"><option value="cold">Cold</option><option value="warm">Warm</option><option value="hot">Hot</option></select></label><label>Tags<input id="edit-tags" type="text" maxlength="800" placeholder="Hosting, WordPress, High value"/></label><label>Follow-up date · UK time<input id="edit-followup" type="datetime-local"/></label><div id="quick-followup" class="quick-followup"></div><button type="submit">Save changes</button></form><button id="convert-job" class="job-button">Create a linked job ↗</button><button id="archive-ticket" class="job-button">Archive enquiry</button><a id="open-job" href="/admin/jobs/" hidden>Open jobs board ↗</a><a id="open-zoho" href="https://www.zoho.com/mail/login.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open Zoho Mail ↗</a><p class="small-copy">Private notes stay in the admin. Attachments can be viewed in Zoho Mail.</p></aside>
</section>
</section>
</main><script>import '../../../scripts/crm.js';</script></body></html>
